Je6Nws3Pq0s\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VuUJBmJPXkTAmF87wz3z4t0ewaH5xes3Z0QkI5Dr7VqZeUHaB5Dz1cYkhT8r8eouHNVDX4PMzAQuG_BythZU\"]]],\"Haunted Merge: Horror Story\",[\"4.3\",4.32],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\"]],[\"qgJlGmMIDEoTCOab4LHHkJcDFYmz2AUd5DsHbvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNwohChtjb20ud2hhbGVqb3kuaG9ycm9yc3RvcnkuZ3AQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"IgTaB-tShew\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:IgTaB-tShew?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:IgTaB-tShew\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlDYdaxNl43o-xmUPpu5amAeADlxrooI5Blk1h1Iz8yCD6ZgBBmWTpi5XrXsdP9rtrlwU_MVphsHX8WK5oUGTY7Lg17gI5ORT2qVJRdljldzr5zgFzlWIj_4UaDZg_n4CaC5yAF_b_fQH0Id1pLnD-GHT6TJCLmVH6mMLh4A_oROHBInLEvTi5N_8EVyOOWhAHy9ZnNEBQXmdh8IhZuLNLg9NigoyRoxj7RfQxyJx75W5jpYasVvgcSwamhYIx8z4m7kbLdEDJqE7Pyg7Ev4Mk6qFAlFrTtFZwOIFO6ebviLw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IgTaB-tShew/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u0026quot;You don\\u0026#39;t see them... but they see you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou’re an orphan, raised by a wandering feng shui master who found you near a graveyard. Before he died, he handed you a locked box—the only clue to your past. After burying him, you begin your journey to uncover the truth.\\u003cbr\\u003eYour first lead brings you to a run-down apartment building. You move in as a tenant—but something is deeply wrong.\\u003cbr\\u003e- The elevator opens by itself—on floors no one pressed.\\u003cbr\\u003e- An empty unit echoes with whispers that don’t exist.\\u003cbr\\u003e- A cursed construction site keeps taking lives...\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat starts as a ghost story becomes something far more disturbing.\\u003cbr\\u003eBecause sometimes, the real horror isn’t the ghost—it’s the people.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003eFace your fears and uncover long-buried secrets\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge clues to reveal hidden truths\\u003cbr\\u003eLook closely - every detail could crack the case\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve puzzles and relax through a hauntingly original experience\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDare to look deeper?\\u003cbr\\u003eYour parents are gone. But why?\\u003cbr\\u003eIs it a curse… or a cover-up?\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you tell what’s real - and what’s a setup?\\u003cbr\\u003eThe deaths keep coming. Accidents? Or something worse?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for players who:\\u003cbr\\u003eLove creepy folktales and chilling mysteries\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy merge mechanics with a twist\\u003cbr\\u003eAre drawn to stories about the dark side of human nature\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is your only way out.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Haunted Merge: Horror Story\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge the evidence. Uncover the truth.\\u003cbr\\u003eExpose the terrifying secrets buried behind every story they tried to erase.\\u0026quot;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/HauntedMergeGames\"],\"WhaleJoy Game Limited\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0J-mq5H4QCThfEQvEoKHXaxMMob0O6a0FxJfT5WvqXTbBLOtZwwhmy3eewvCOJkmznnuykYnYu424DPKBYUq5w\"],null,[18,20,18,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Horror\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\