personalities!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSOLVE addictive puzzles with challenging obstacles!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSTYLIZE your avatar to stand out on the red carpet!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVISIT FRIENDS and see how they dressed their avatar!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBLAST through levels with exciting power-ups with explosive benefits!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSupport: Dear Director, are you having problems with the game? Visit https://support.projectmakeover.com/ or contact us in-game by going to Settings \\u0026gt;Help \\u0026gt;Contact Us.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://www.projectmakeover.com/privacy-policy/\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://www.projectmakeover.com/terms-of-service/\"],\"Magic Tavern, Inc.\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nyu-UDM_-RHGULZBwmQcWmTn5vSAN1NFJcNuoQR-Jba7Q4sJ9BQLqx4DjEgfhHtVpFQCGdIDMcRN-W7vdzLYRw\"],null,[28,69,190,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bgg.jump\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bgg.jump\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],