 strategic gameplays\\u003cbr\\u003e- Collect and match, unravel the mysteries of the void\\u003cbr\\u003e- Strengthen your power, and form alliances with others to receive the greatest support!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eContact Us - FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/heroclashbattle\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e* This is a Free to Play game that offers in-app purchases for virtual currency, items, and other paid services. Please make moderate purchases based on personal interests and financial capability.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Please be mindful of your gaming time to avoid addiction. Prolonged gameplay may disrupt your routine, so it\\u0026#39;s advisable to take regular breaks and engage in physical activities.\"],\"Glaciers Game\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jDscY65gc1MenAivFW6Yibw_Vmwgvm2McnzlNEp4mNGddJ0E_drlyPN7N__s_1HErX7tNFvKZV5vHmLZnv2HZw\"],null,[146,55,26,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.xgame.newasia.sea.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.xgame.newasia.sea.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT